DNeo inference release candidate

The optimized runtime and reference arithmetic derive from this project's DNeo
implementation in SpecForge. The preserved project LICENSE is MIT, copyright
2025 sgl-project. Preserve this notice and the original license when redistributing.

Native serving reuses SGLang's DFlashWorkerV2 speculative verification and
scheduling. The SGLang project is distributed under its own MIT license:
https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang

The model uses Hugging Face Transformers' Qwen3 MLP, RMSNorm and rotary components.
Transformers is distributed under Apache-2.0:
https://github.com/huggingface/transformers/blob/main/LICENSE

DFlash, DFlash-2 and dSparK informed the architecture. No baseline weights are
included. Public target weights must be obtained separately from Qwen/Qwen3-4B
under their applicable model license. The release's model-weight license and
ownership/attribution review must be confirmed before publishing.
